      "content": "Since his fever is high, and he is showing signs of confusion or being unusually slow, it would be best to call his doctor for advice rather than relying only on over-the-counter medication. Confusion along with a high fever should always be taken seriously, as it can signal something more than just a lingering flu. If you feel his mental status is rapidly worsening or he becomes unresponsive, please do not hesitate to seek emergency care.",
